@startuml
' Figure 31.6  The approval gate
' Reading order: top to bottom. A $940 refund files a card; the agent
' and an over-limit approver are refused; the team lead approves the
' digest she saw; the retry gets a 15-minute permission. From policy.demo --part approval.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Policy engine" as E <<policy>>
participant "Team lead" as T <<org>>
A -> E : Refund 940.00
E --> A : Approve needed, card
E -> T : Card with arguments
A -[$FAIL]> E : Approves own card
E --> A : Refused
T -> E : Approve this digest
A -> E : Retry same arguments
E --> A : Permission, 15 min
@enduml
